00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:44.900
Don't worry about it.

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:45.520
Forget it.

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:45.900
Good.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:47.660
Do you think

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:48.620
Trenton's really going to have

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:49.680
pony rides next year?

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.420
Only one way to find out.

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.180
Nice gift to Fenton, by the way.

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:53.900
Hey, Brendan,

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:55.000
do you know what would have been better?

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:55.340
What?

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:56.940
If there had been some

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.040
special effects in there.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:20:59.970
You know, it could have been better.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:00.780
but I didn't have time.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:01.880
Well, I know, I'm just saying.

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:02.880
Hey, I was just thinking,

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:04.620
what if Jason jumps off a bridge

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:05.900
onto a moving bus?

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:07.640
And then me and you

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:08.660
find on top of the bus.

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:10.500
And then I kick out a window on the bus

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:11.440
and I climb on top?

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:11.780
Right.

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:17.760
uh no no no no i got it i got it we climb up a telephone pole and um

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:19.000
fix the line.

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:21.590
Fix the telephone pole

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:23.330
It's not really so action packed

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:24.510
It's very dangerous

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:26.830
I do like where that's going a lot

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:29.590
Because then we can wear those hats

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:31.010
Oh.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:31.820
and the belts

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:36.530
Or we climb up the telephone pole, Brendan, and Melissa gets electrocuted.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:37.150
Hey.

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:41.320
And jump onto a helicopter, and then Melissa gets split in half.

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:43.590
Why is something bad always happening to me?

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:45.520
It's funnier when it happens to the girl.

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:47.800
Thank you.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:00.140
You
